    "detailed_description": "Dirt Bike Unlimited bike experience  offers you the unique opportunity to become a true master of motorcycle crafting. Choose from a variety of parts, from wheels to exhaust, to assemble your perfect bike. Each detail is customizable down to the smallest features, including color and finish.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnce your dirt bike is ready, embark on thrilling off-road adventures! Explore diverse landscapes, including mountains, forests, and deserts, overcoming obstacles and performing exhilarating jumps. Collect checkpoints to progress further and refine your control skills to conquer the most challenging trails.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy a vast array of content, including diverse maps and challenges. Dirt Bike Unlimited bike experience  will be your ticket to the world of thrilling races and exciting two-wheeled adventures!",
    "about_the_game": "Dirt Bike Unlimited bike experience  offers you the unique opportunity to become a true master of motorcycle crafting. Choose from a variety of parts, from wheels to exhaust, to assemble your perfect bike. Each detail is customizable down to the smallest features, including color and finish.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnce your dirt bike is ready, embark on thrilling off-road adventures! Explore diverse landscapes, including mountains, forests, and deserts, overcoming obstacles and performing exhilarating jumps. Collect checkpoints to progress further and refine your control skills to conquer the most challenging trails.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy a vast array of content, including diverse maps and challenges. Dirt Bike Unlimited bike experience  will be your ticket to the world of thrilling races and exciting two-wheeled adventures!",
    "short_description": "Craft your ultimate off-road machine by customizing every part, from wheels to exhaust. Race through sprawling landscapes, mastering jumps to hit checkpoints before time runs out. Explore the wilderness, conquer the trails, and become the off-road champion!",
